s":20},{"base":"H4480","lemma":"מִן־","tr":"min","gloss":"from","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":1187},{"base":"H8269","lemma":"שַׂר","tr":"sar","gloss":"ruler","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":421},{"base":"H6659","lemma":"צָדוֹק","tr":"tsa·doq","gloss":"Zadok","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":53}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"LEV","chapter":10,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"So fire came out from the presence of the LORD and consumed them, and they died in the presence of the LORD.","from":2},{"book":"EXO","chapter":6,"verse":23,"verseEnd":23,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And Aaron married Elisheba, the daughter of Amminadab and sister of Nahshon, and she bore him Nadab and Abihu, Eleazar and Ithamar.","from":1},{"book":"EXO","chapter":24,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Then the LORD said to Moses, “Come up to the LORD—you and Aaron, Nadab and Abihu, and seventy of Israelʼs elders—and you are to worship at a distance.","from":2},{"book":"EXO","chapter":24,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Then Moses went up with Aaron, Nadab and Abihu, and seventy of the elders of Israel,","from":2},{"book":"EXO","chapter":28,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"“Next, have your brother Aaron brought to you from among the Israelites, along with his sons Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar, and Ithamar, to serve Me as priests.","from":1},{"book":"EXO","chapter":29,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Wrap the sashes around Aaron and his sons and tie headbands on them. The priesthood shall be theirs by a permanent statute. In this way you are to ordain Aaron and his sons.","from":2},{"book":"LEV","chapter":10,"verse":1,"verseEnd":6,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Now Aaronʼs sons Nadab and Abihu took their censers, put fire in them and added incense, and offered unauthorized fire before the LORD, contrary to His command. So fire came out from the presence of the LORD and consumed them, and they died in the presence of the LORD. Then Moses said to Aaron, “This is what the LORD meant when He said: ‘To those who come near Me I will show My holiness, and in the sight of all the people I will reveal My glory.’” But Aaron remained silent. Moses summoned Mishael and Elzaphan, sons of Aaronʼs uncle Uzziel, and said to them, “Come here; carry the bodies of your cousins outside the camp, away from the front of the sanctuary.” So they came forward and carried them, still in their tunics, outside the camp, as Moses had directed.","from":1},{"book":"LEV","chapter":10,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And Moses said to Aaron and his remaining sons, Eleazar and Ithamar, “Take the grain offering that remains from the food offerings to the LORD and eat it without leaven beside the altar, because it is most holy.","from":2}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"kings-prophets","title":"Kings, prophets and the house of David","people":3},{"id":"exodus-family","title":"Moses and his circle","people":2}]},"7-19":{"people":[{"id":"jedaiah-h3048h","name":"Jedaiah","kind":"person","brief":"A priest","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"jehoiarib-h3080g","name":"Jehoiarib","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"harim-h2766g","name":"Harim","kind":"person","brief":"Priestly division","count":1,"firstVerse":8},{"id":"seorim-h8188","name":"Seorim","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":8},{"id":"malchijah-h4441i","name":"Malchijah","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":9},{"id":"mijamin-h4326g","name":"Mijamin","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":9},{"id":"abijah-h0029l","name":"Abijah","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"hakkoz-h6976h","name":"Hakkoz","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"jeshua-h3442g","name":"Jeshua","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"shecaniah-h7935h","name":"Shecaniah","kind":"person","brief"