vid","kind":"person","brief":"King of Judah","count":1,"firstVerse":31},{"id":"zadok-h6659g","name":"Zadok","kind":"person","brief":"A High Priest","count":1,"firstVerse":31}],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"H3449","lemma":"יִשִּׁיָּהוּ","tr":"yish·shiy·yah","gloss":"Isshiah","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":7},{"base":"H4249","lemma":"מַחְלִי","tr":"mach·li","gloss":"Mahli","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":12},{"base":"H4318","lemma":"מִיכָה","tr":"mi·khah","gloss":"Micah","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":33},{"base":"H3269","lemma":"יַעֲזִיָּ֫הוּ","tr":"ya·a·ziy·ya·hu","gloss":"Jaaziah","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":2},{"base":"H8013","lemma":"שְׁלֹמוֹת","tr":"she·lo·mot","gloss":"Shelomoth","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":3},{"base":"H7345","lemma":"רְחַבְיָהוּ","tr":"re·chav·yah","gloss":"Rehabiah","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":5},{"base":"H7619","lemma":"שְׁבוּאֵל","tr":"she·vu·el","gloss":"Shebuel","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":6},{"base":"H4187","lemma":"מוּשִׁי","tr":"mu·shi","gloss":"Mushi","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":8},{"base":"H7027","lemma":"קִישׁ","tr":"qish","gloss":"Kish","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":21},{"base":"H5980","lemma":"עֻמָּה","tr":"um·mah","gloss":"close","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":32}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"1CH","chapter":23,"verse":19,"verseEnd":19,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"The sons of Hebron: Jeriah was the first, Amariah the second, Jahaziel the third, and Jekameam the fourth.","from":23},{"book":"1CH","chapter":24,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":5,"source":"openbible","text":"Thus they were divided by lot, for there were officers of the sanctuary and officers of God among both Eleazarʼs and Ithamarʼs descendants.","from":31},{"book":"1CH","chapter":24,"verse":6,"verseEnd":6,"votes":5,"source":"openbible","text":"The scribe, Shemaiah son of Nethanel, a Levite, recorded their names in the presence of the king and of the officers: Zadok the priest, Ahimelech son of Abiathar, and the heads of families of the priests and the Levites—one family being taken from Eleazar, and then one from Ithamar.","from":31},{"book":"EXO","chapter":6,"verse":19,"verseEnd":19,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The sons of Merari were Mahli and Mushi. These were the clans of the Levites according to their records.","from":27},{"book":"EXO","chapter":6,"verse":21,"verseEnd":21,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The sons of Izhar were Korah, Nepheg, and Zichri.","from":22},{"book":"NUM","chapter":3,"verse":19,"verseEnd":19,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The sons of Kohath by their clans were Amram, Izhar, Hebron, and Uzziel.","from":22},{"book":"NUM","chapter":3,"verse":20,"verseEnd":20,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And the sons of Merari by their clans were Mahli and Mushi. These were the clans of the Levites, according to their families.","from":27},{"book":"NUM","chapter":3,"verse":27,"verseEnd":27,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"From Kohath came the clans of the Amramites, the Izharites, the Hebronites, and the Uzzielites; these were the clans of the Kohathites.","from":22}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"exodus-family","title":"Moses and his circle","people":3},{"id":"kings-prophets","title":"Kings, prophets and the house of David","people":2}]}}